## Why This Is Asked
The question probes building a scalable, compliant AI-driven analytics pipeline across regions with real-time scoring, custom intents, and robust data lineage.

## Key Concepts
- Event-driven orchestration (Step Functions)
- Transcription + custom inference (SageMaker)
- Data lineage (Glue Catalog)
- Cross-region data synchronization (DynamoDB)
- Privacy (KMS, access logs)

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example pseudo-logic
async function process(fileKey){
  const transcript = await transcribe(fileKey);
  const quality = await scoreTranscription(transcript);
  const intents = await inferIntents(transcript);
  await store(transcript, fileKey);
  await upsertIndex({callId, transcriptKey:fileKey, language:quality.language, qualityScore:quality.score, intents, region});
}
```

